    <string name="diag_patch_title">⚠ MBF says "Awaiting patch generation"?</string>
    <string name="diag_patch_body">This is normal when Beat Saber has just updated. The MBF team has to generate new mod patches, which takes 1–48 hours. You cannot mod until patches are ready.\n\nFix: wait and check back later. Watch the Discord for patch announcements so you know the moment it\'s ready.</string>
